         servers.  They are not identical, because the actual peers this would
         load balance to each server are different for each example.

         You must only have sspplliitt or hhbbaa defined, never both.  For most cases,
         the fine‐grained control that hhbbaa offers isn’t necessary,  and  sspplliitt
